SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later

This repository contains Linux kernel driver source, firmware packaging,
and install helpers for AIC8800D80-based USB Wi-Fi adapters.

Unless a file states a different license, the repository glue code,
documentation, and install helpers authored for this repository are released
under GPL-2.0-or-later.

Upstream driver files keep their original copyright and license notices.
The bundled src/aic8800-1.0.9/driverctl file declares GPL-3.0-or-later.
Firmware files under firmware/aic8800D80 are redistributed as vendor firmware
needed by the device and are not authored by this repository.

See NOTICE.md for provenance and redistribution notes.

